;'-acabe8416923c479END_WIDGET\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">UNI_BOOK_LOW_CountingHouse_VaultsPamphlet</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:UNI_BOOK_LOW_CountingHouse_VaultsPamphlet\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:UNI_BOOK_LOW_CountingHouse_VaultsPamphlet\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">d7908626-8248-4cda-b7a0-d1a36551f94b</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:d7908626-8248-4cda-b7a0-d1a36551f94b\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:d7908626-8248-4cda-b7a0-d1a36551f94b\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/The_Counting_House\" title=\"The Counting House\">The Counting House</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-87&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-179</span></li>\n<li>In a stack of scrolls in <a href=\"/wiki/The_Counting_House#The_Counting_House_-_Vaults\" title=\"The Counting House\">The Counting House Vaults</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-944&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;791</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>Renowned across the land for protecting treasures great and small, our vaults offer security like no other.\n</p><p><br>\nThe Grand Vault\n</p><p>Citizens of <a href=\"/wiki/Baldur%27s_Gate\" title=\"Baldur's Gate\">Baldur's Gate</a>, you can rest easy knowing that your hard-earned coin is safe behind the stone and steel that protects our Grand Vault. A single high-security vault containing the wealth of the ordinary people, the Grand Vault protects everything from your grocer's profits to your grandmother's savings.\n</p><p><br>\nThe Deep Vaults\n</p><p>Our Deep Vaults are for citizens whose fortunes require an individual vault or unique security measures. With extra patrols, wards, and more, you can deposit, withdraw, or view your treasure at your leisure.\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714234421\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.049 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.051 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1366/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 26692/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 7922/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 1/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.011/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 931279/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   41.211      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   41.211      1 -total\n 50.49%   20.806      6 Template:Icon_text\n 44.84%   18.478     15 Template:Trim\n 24.14%    9.948      2 Template:Uid\n 16.46%    6.782      1 Template:Main_only\n 13.79%    5.685      2 Template:Template_style\n 11.11%   